Change the \\hl{A,B,C} highlight colors to look better in dark mode, I want the \\hlB to be more like transparent red almost as if the red character is briefly acting as a redactor. \\hlA should be dark grey but lighter than the page background in dark mode, and light grey in light mode. \\hlC can be the same as R's background but not blue text. Make all these colors dynamically by blending the font colors for the A, B, and C characters to make them dark and translucent in dark mode, and light and translucent in light mode.
EOF
